---
title: CMN — Frontend Bootstrap (Web Apps — Admin + Main)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant APP as React App Root<br/>(Vite / Next.js)
    participant STORE as Redux Store
    participant HTTP as @core/http<br/>(Axios instance)
    participant COOKIE as Browser Cookies
    participant LS as localStorage

    Note over B,LS: App Initialization

    B->>APP: Load page
    APP->>STORE: createStore() — init all slices<br/>(employee, role, party in initState)

    APP->>HTTP: Create Axios instance<br/>baseURL: VITE_API_URL (admin) or NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL (web-app)<br/>timeout: 3 minutes (180000ms)

    Note over HTTP,LS: Register Request Interceptor
    HTTP->>HTTP: interceptors.request.use()
    HTTP->>COOKIE: Read ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY
    COOKIE-->>HTTP: accessToken (or null)
    HTTP->>HTTP: Set Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
    HTTP->>LS: Read tenantId
    LS-->>HTTP: tenantId
    HTTP->>HTTP: Set X-Tenant: {tenantId}
    HTTP->>HTTP: Set Accept-Language: vi

    Note over HTTP,COOKIE: Register Response Interceptor
    HTTP->>HTTP: interceptors.response.use(onSuccess, onError)

    APP-->>B: Render application (initial route)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over B,COOKIE: 401 Auto-Refresh (triggered by any failed API call)
        B->>HTTP: Any API request → 401 Unauthorized
        HTTP->>COOKIE: Read REFRESH_TOKEN_KEY
        COOKIE-->>HTTP: refreshToken
        HTTP->>HTTP: POST .../api/auth/refresh-login { RefreshToken }
        HTTP-->>HTTP: New tokens received
        HTTP->>COOKIE: Set ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY = newAccessToken
        HTTP->>COOKIE: Set REFRESH_TOKEN_KEY = newRefreshToken
        HTTP->>HTTP: Retry original request with new token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over B,APP: Error Routing
        B->>HTTP: API response 403
        HTTP->>APP: Navigate to /403
        B->>HTTP: API response 404
        HTTP->>APP: Navigate to /404
        B->>HTTP: API response 500
        HTTP->>APP: Navigate to /500
    end
